                {
                  "text": "Nyut 18.23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abino giko oko i boma luŋ me Juda kede i dye yo luŋ me Jerucalem woo me yomcuny a jo, yomcuny ame anyom tye kede karacel kede me atera; pien lobo-nono bino doko wi obur ame tye nono.”",
          "type": "text",
